<title>UK: NWE jet premiums holding, but physical very slow.</title>
<headline>NWE jet premiums holding, but physical very slow.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>European jet fuel was marginally weaker on Monday, but trade was very slow.</p>
<p>&quot;To say its quiet is an understatement,&quot; said one trader.</p>
<p>Premiums were understood to be holding with second half February barges pegged around March IPE +$26 and cargoes at March IPE +$28 cif NWE.</p>
<p>Dealers said IP week in London has drawn out much of the market liquidity.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8980</p>
